- Refactor `getAuditLogs()`:
  - Query all expenses, sorting by `updatedAt` descending.
  - Generate audit log objects for submission, approval, and rejection events with formatted timestamps, actors, messages, and references (e.g. `EXP-XXXX`).

#### [MODIFY] [reporting.controller.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/reporting/reporting.controller.ts)
